                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, POL 7 US/McNAMARA. Secret. Received
                    at 5:15 a.m. and passed to the Department of Defense for McNamara at 6 a.m. and
                    to the White House at 6:03 a.m.</p>
            </note>
